            "review_title": "Review at The local",
            "review_text": "Jacky W\n51 contributions\n0\nLovely Seafood restaurant\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nGreeted at the door by Lina who explained the menu extremely well using very good English and we decided to grab a table .\nFirst time of eating crab - sweet and delicious ( small crab ordered - just enough as a taster for 2 )\nStaff prepared it for us .\nAlso had a mixed platter ( clams , muscles , oysters , fish goujons , prawns, and salad equally delicious and enough for 2 as a main.\nWould definitely return.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2026",
