            "review_title": "Review at The local",
            "review_text": "Yulia L\n17 contributions\n0\nThe local restaurant by Vin Diesel\nNov 2025 • Friends\nExcellent restaurant with Vietnamese, Russian and European cuisine. The quality of the dishes is excellent and very delicious and quick to cook.\nYou can taste traditional Vietnamese dishes and even exotic - turtle soup, ostrich or crocodile roast, frogs. A large selection of seafood. But there is also the usual Russian cuisine including okroshka and dumplings.\nGreat service. They speak Russian and English. Practically in the center of the city, close to hotels and waterfront. \nWe had lunch and dinner throughout our vacation.\nThank you so much to Vin and his wonderful wife for taking care of us!\nI highly recommend visiting!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten November 5, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
