            "review_title": "Review at The local",
            "review_text": "Татьяна Д\n1 contribution\n0\nThe best place in Nha Trang 😊\nJul 2025 • Family\nOn the day of arrival in Nha Trang on 10.07.2025, let's go as a family to find somewhere to eat) \nAlong the way, we were stopped by an affable Vietnamese, and invited (in Russian) to come to them for a meal🤗☺\nI knew right away that we would eat in Nha Trang only here 😊 Diverse and simply delicious menu!😋 Prices are not overstated, (they specifically compared prices in other restaurants). Portions are decent, we just ate 🤣\nDefinitely recommend this place! Next time we'll definitely come back here ☺\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 1, 2025",
